  We Meet on Vacation</em>\, <em>The Hunger Games: Ballad of Songbirds and 
 Snakes</em>)\, and directed by six-time Tony Award&reg\; winner Michael Ar
 den (<em>Maybe Happy Ending</em>)\, <em>A Few Good Men</em> shows the cost
  of following your conscience in a system built on secrecy and obedience&m
 dash\;and asks us to choose the truth anyway. Gripping\, high-stakes\, and
  ultimately hopeful\, it reminds us that a country&rsquo\;s ideals are onl
 y as strong as our willingness to stand behind them.</p>
LOCATION:Lincoln Center Theater-Vivian Beaumont\, 150 West 65th Street\, N
 ew York NY 10023
END:VEVENT
